# What never merges by the line's policy alone: a pull request changing one
# of these waits for the person's `workline:accepted` label. workline reads
# this list (ADR-0068 §4); GitHub's required code-owner review stays off,
# since an author cannot approve their own pull request.
# Every other file, role prompts included, takes the line's normal path.

# This list, the agents' rules, the principles.
/CODEOWNERS @JN0V
/AGENTS.md @JN0V
/CLAUDE.md @JN0V
/docs/PRINCIPLES.md @JN0V

# What runs the checks and holds the App's key.
/.github/workflows/ @JN0V
/.github/actions/ @JN0V

# Merge autonomy, routing, gates, the reviewer's ignore list, each role's level.
/.workline/config.yaml @JN0V

